<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="750" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001931BF00" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-size: 14px; font-variant-ligatures: none; background-color: rgb(244, 245, 246);"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="000000001931C160"><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001931C3C0"><td data_liveedit_tagid="000000001931C620" style="line-height: 20px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="680" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001931C880" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: center;"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="000000001931CAE0"><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001931CD40"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001931CFA0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001931D200" style="background-color: rgb(244, 245, 246);"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="000000001931D460"><tr width="680" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001931D6C0"><td align="center" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001931D920" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; text-align: center; height: 60px; width: 680px;"><div data_liveedit_tagid="000000001931DB80" style="height: 15px; line-height: 15px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></div><div data_liveedit_tagid="000000001931E170" style="height: 15px; line-height: 15px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Earn Points. Save on Flights. Manage Travel</font></div><div data_liveedit_tagid="000000001931E500" style="height: 15px; line-height: 15px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></div></td></tr></tbody></table><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001931F330" style="width: 680px;"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="000000001931F590"><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001931F7F0"><td data_liveedit_tagid="000000001931FA50" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/business-rewards/home.html" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-decoration-line: none; border: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><img border="0" src="https://www.qantas.com/content/dam/qantas/sales-news/salesforce-email-assets/QBR_eDM_Banner.jpg" title="Qantas Business Rewards" style="width: 680px;"></font></a></td></tr></tbody></table><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" id="main-content" width="600" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000019320BB0" style="text-align: center; width: 600px; margin-left: 40px; margin-right: 40px;"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="0000000019320E10"><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000019321070"><td align="center" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000193212D0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; text-align: left;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="600" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000019321780"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="00000000193219E0"><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000019321C40"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000019321EA0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 40px; height: 30px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="00000000193226D0"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000019322930" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Hi {!Contact.FirstName},</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000019322DF0"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000019323050" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000019323510"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000019323770" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">I have attempted to contact you over the last few months regarding the Level 3 Qantas Business Rewards Account held by&nbsp;<mark data_liveedit_tagid="00000000193239D0">XXXX</mark>&nbsp;as you are listed as the Account Holder for the business, however I have had no success in reaching you.<br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001931FDE0"><br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000019323D60">As a Level 3 Qantas Business Rewards member, you have access to the highest level of benefits and discounts available in the program. The purpose of my call was to assist you with maximising the benefits available to your business and to take you through the features you have access to in the Qantas Business Rewards Account.<br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000019323FA0"><br data_liveedit_tagid="00000000193240B0">If you would like to lock in a time to discuss your Qantas Business Rewards membership and benefits in more detail, please feel free to contact&nbsp;<a href="mailtio:corpsalesaus@qantas.com.au" target="_blank" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000193242F0" style="color: rgb(223, 0, 0); border: 0px;">corpsalesaus@qantas.com.au</a>&nbsp;and advise your preferred date and time for a call. A member of our team will happily reach out.<br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000019324680"><br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000019324790">In the meantime, below is a short overview of some of the benefits available to you through Qantas Business Rewards:</font><ul data_liveedit_tagid="00000000193249D0" style="margin: 5px 0px 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 1px;"><li data_liveedit_tagid="0000000019324C30" style="margin: 15px 0px 0px; padding: 0px 10px 0px 0px;"><a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/business-rewards/qbr/myaccount" target="_blank" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000019324D60" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); border: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Your Qantas Business Rewards Account</font></a></li><li data_liveedit_tagid="00000000193250F0" style="margin: 15px 0px 0px; padding: 0px 10px 0px 0px;"><a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/business-rewards/earn-points-and-save-on-flights.html" target="_blank" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000019325220" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); border: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Qantas Business Rewards flying benefits</font></a></li><li data_liveedit_tagid="00000000193255B0" style="margin: 15px 0px 0px; padding: 0px 10px 0px 0px;"><a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/business-rewards/save-on-qantas-club.html" target="_blank" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000193256E0" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); border: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Qantas Business Rewards exclusive Qantas Club discount</font></a></li><li data_liveedit_tagid="0000000019325A70" style="margin: 15px 0px 0px; padding: 0px 10px 0px 0px;"><a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/business-rewards/gold-accelerator.html" target="_blank" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000019325BA0" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); border: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Exclusive Qantas Business Rewards Level 3 Gold Accelerator</font></a></li><li data_liveedit_tagid="0000000019325F30" style="margin: 15px 0px 0px; padding: 0px 10px 0px 0px;"><a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/business-rewards/earn-points-on-business-expenses.html" target="_blank" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000019326060" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); border: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Earn points on business expenses through our 50+ partners</font></a></li><li data_liveedit_tagid="00000000193263F0" style="margin: 15px 0px 0px; padding: 0px 10px 0px 0px;"><a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/business-rewards/news/how-to-guides/stored-travellers.html" target="_blank" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000019326520" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); border: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">How to make the most out of the stored traveller feature</font></a></li><li data_liveedit_tagid="00000000193268B0" style="margin: 15px 0px 0px; padding: 0px 10px 0px 0px;"><a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/business-rewards/news/how-to-guides.html" target="_blank" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000193269E0" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); border: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Qantas Business Rewards How-To Guides</font></a></li><li data_liveedit_tagid="0000000019326D70" style="margin: 15px 0px 0px; padding: 0px 10px 0px 0px;"><a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/business-rewards/faqs.html" target="_blank" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000019326EA0" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); border: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Qantas Business Rewards FAQs</font></a></li></ul></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="00000000193276E0"><td data_liveedit_tagid="0000000019327940" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;<br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000019327E00"></font><hr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000019327F10" style="height: 2px; border-width: 0px; color: rgb(218, 218, 218); background-color: rgb(218, 218, 218);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;<br data_liveedit_tagid="00000000193283B0"></font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000019328BC0"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000019328E20" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000019329080"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001F3BC5B0"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001F3BC810" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; padding: 0px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001F3BCA70"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001F3BCCD0"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001F3BCF30" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; padding: 0px;"><img src="https://www.qantas.com/content/dam/qantas/sales-news/salesforce-email-assets/icons/icon-flights.png" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001F3BD3E0" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: none; display: block; width: 48px;"></td></tr></tbody></table></td><td data_liveedit_tagid="000000001F3BDAE0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; width: 30px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;<br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001F3BDFA0"></font></td><td align="center" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001F3BE430" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; vertical-align: top; padding: 0px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001F3BE690"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001F3BE8F0"><td align="left" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001F3BEB50" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><strong data_liveedit_tagid="000000001F3BEDB0">Save on flights</strong><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001F3BF140">Take your business even further for less, with up to 10% savings on eligible domestic and international fares to over 1,300 destinations with Qantas,&nbsp;<strong data_liveedit_tagid="000000001F3BF380">one</strong>world<sup data_liveedit_tagid="000000001F3BF710" style="font-size: 10px; line-height: 8px;">®</sup>&nbsp;and partner airlines<sup data_liveedit_tagid="000000001F3BFAA0" style="font-size: 10px; line-height: 8px;">~</sup>. Plus, enjoy a range of exclusive offers on top of your year-round member savings on international and domestic flights for even more value.</font></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001F3C0A00"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001F3C0C60" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 25px; height: 25px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001F3C1370"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001F3C15D0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" height="50px" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001F3C1830"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001F3C1A90"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001F3C1CF0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; padding: 0px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001F3C1F50"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001F3C21B0"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001F3C2410" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; padding: 0px; height: 50px;"><img src="https://www.qantas.com/content/dam/qantas/sales-news/salesforce-email-assets/icons/icon-points.png" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001F3C28C0" style="margin: 0px; vertical-align: top; padding: 0px; border: none; display: block;"></td></tr></tbody></table></td><td data_liveedit_tagid="000000001F3C2FC0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; width: 30px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;<br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001F3C3480"></font></td><td align="center" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001F3C3910" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; vertical-align: top; padding: 0px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001F3C3B70"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001F3C3DD0"><td align="left" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001F3C4030" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><strong data_liveedit_tagid="000000001F3C4290">Earn Qantas Points for your Business &amp; additional Qantas Points for your&nbsp;team</strong><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001F3C4AE0">Earn points* for your business on top of the points and Status Credits you and your employees earn as a Frequent Flyer<sup data_liveedit_tagid="000000001F3C4D20" style="font-size: 10px; line-height: 8px;">#</sup>. As a Level 3 member, you can earn 40 Qantas Points for your business for every 100 points your flyers earn. Plus, your team will earn an additional 250 bonus Qantas Points every time they fly for work, on top of the points and Status Credits they already earn<sup data_liveedit_tagid="000000001F3C50B0" style="font-size: 10px; line-height: 8px;">#</sup>. Plus, book a hotel through your Business Account and earn even more - up to 6 points per $1 spent (3 points for the business, and 3 points for the Frequent Flyer.)</font></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001F3C6010"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001F3C6270" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 25px; height: 25px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001F3C6980"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001F3C6BE0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001F3C6E40"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001F3C70A0"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001F3C7300" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; padding: 0px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001F3C7560"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001F3C77C0"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001F3C7A20" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; padding: 0px;"><img src="https://www.qantas.com/content/dam/qantas/sales-news/salesforce-email-assets/icons/qbr-icon-business-account-48x48.png" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001F3C7ED0" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: none; display: block; width: 48px;"></td></tr></tbody></table></td><td data_liveedit_tagid="000000001F3C85D0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; width: 30px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;<br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001F3C8A90"></font></td><td align="center" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001F3C8F20" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; vertical-align: top; padding: 0px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001F3C9180"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001F3C93E0"><td align="left" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001F3C9640" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><strong data_liveedit_tagid="000000001F3C98A0">Business travel</strong><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001F3C9C30">Easily book and manage flights, hotels and car hire directly from your Business Account. Enabling you to easily manage all aspects of your business travel in one place. All the Qantas Points your business earns on Qantas and Jetstar flights, Qantas hotels and car hire count towards your membership level, making it easier to retain your Level 3 savings and benefits.</font></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001F3CAA40"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001F3CACA0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 25px; height: 25px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001F3CB3B0"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001F3CB610" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001F3CB870"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001F3CBAD0"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001F3CBD30" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; padding: 0px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001F3CBF90"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001F3CC1F0"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000095DC9D0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; padding: 0px;"><img src="https://www.qantas.com/content/dam/qantas/sales-news/salesforce-email-assets/icons/qbr-icon-reporting-48x48.png" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000095DCE80" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: none; display: block; width: 48px;"></td></tr></tbody></table></td><td data_liveedit_tagid="00000000095DD580" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; width: 30px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;<br data_liveedit_tagid="00000000095DDA40"></font></td><td align="center" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000095DDED0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; vertical-align: top; padding: 0px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000095DE130"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="00000000095DE390"><td align="left" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000095DE5F0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><strong data_liveedit_tagid="00000000095DE850">Access real-time reporting and set up your business' travel policy</strong><br data_liveedit_tagid="00000000095DEBE0">Create and manage your business’ Travel Policy. Plus, through real-time reporting, gain valuable insights into your team’s booking behaviour, track your travel spend, report on policy compliance and easily download expense reports.</font></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="00000000095DF9F0"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000095DFC50" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 25px; height: 25px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="00000000095E0360"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000095E05C0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000095E0820"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="00000000095E0A80"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000095E0CE0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; padding: 0px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000095E0F40"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="00000000095E11A0"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000095E1400" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; padding: 0px;"><img src="https://www.qantas.com/content/dam/qantas/sales-news/salesforce-email-assets/icons/offer-icon.png" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000095E18B0" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: none; display: block; width: 48px;"></td></tr></tbody></table></td><td data_liveedit_tagid="00000000095E1FB0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; width: 30px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;<br data_liveedit_tagid="00000000095E2470"></font></td><td align="center" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000095E2900" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; vertical-align: top; padding: 0px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000095E2B60"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="00000000095E2DC0"><td align="left" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000095E3020" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><strong data_liveedit_tagid="00000000095E3280">Fast-track to Gold</strong><br data_liveedit_tagid="00000000095E3610">Level 3 members can exclusively nominate 1 traveller to fast track their Frequent Flyer status to Gold, per year.<sup data_liveedit_tagid="00000000095E3850" style="font-size: 9px; line-height: 8px;">§</sup>&nbsp;Only 100 Status Credits are required to be earnt in a 90-day period to achieve Gold.</font></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="00000000095E47B0"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000095E4A10" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 25px; height: 25px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="00000000095E4ED0"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000095E5130" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Just ensure you and your team&nbsp;<strong data_liveedit_tagid="00000000095E5390">include your business' ABN and Qantas Frequent Flyer number in the booking so you never miss a point.</strong></font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="00000000095E5BD0"><td data_liveedit_tagid="00000000095E5E30" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;<br data_liveedit_tagid="00000000095E62F0"></font><hr data_liveedit_tagid="00000000095E6400" style="height: 2px; border-width: 0px; color: rgb(218, 218, 218); background-color: rgb(218, 218, 218);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;<br data_liveedit_tagid="00000000095E68A0"></font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="00000000095E6E60"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000095E70C0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><mark data_liveedit_tagid="00000000095E7320"><strong data_liveedit_tagid="00000000095E7450"><em data_liveedit_tagid="00000000095E7580">**If customer uses TMC (review HCF)**</em></strong></mark><br data_liveedit_tagid="00000000095E7910">Should your business make bookings via a Travel Agent, I have attached a Qantas Business Rewards Agent Toolkit that can be shared with your agent to support them in accessing these benefits on your behalf. I have also included a customer version should you wish to reference a more detailed overview of your program benefits.<br data_liveedit_tagid="00000000095E7B50"><br data_liveedit_tagid="00000000095E7C60"><mark data_liveedit_tagid="00000000095E7EA0"><strong data_liveedit_tagid="00000000095E7FD0"><em data_liveedit_tagid="00000000095E8100">**If customer is direct (review HCF)**</em></strong></mark><br data_liveedit_tagid="00000000095E8490">I have attached a Qantas Business Rewards Customer Toolkit that you can reference for a complete overview of your program benefits.<br data_liveedit_tagid="00000000095E86D0"><br data_liveedit_tagid="00000000095E87E0">If you require any assistance or wish to speak with a team member regarding your account, please contact the relevant team below.</font><ul data_liveedit_tagid="00000000095E8A20" style="margin: 5px 0px 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 1px;"><li data_liveedit_tagid="00000000095E8C80" style="margin: 15px 0px 0px; padding: 0px 10px 0px 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><strong data_liveedit_tagid="00000000095E8DB0">Qantas Business Rewards: 13 74 78 option 1</strong>, for non-booking related queries, updating profile information, login assistance.</font></li><li data_liveedit_tagid="00000000095E9270" style="margin: 15px 0px 0px; padding: 0px 10px 0px 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><strong data_liveedit_tagid="00000000095E93A0">Qantas Business Rewards: 13 74 78 option 2</strong>, for booking related queries (please note any bookings made via a Travel Agent will need to be managed via your Travel Agent).</font></li><li data_liveedit_tagid="00000000095E9860" style="margin: 15px 0px 0px; padding: 0px 10px 0px 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><strong data_liveedit_tagid="00000000095E9990">Qantas Club: 13 74 78 option 1</strong>, or join via your&nbsp;<a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/business-rewards/qbr/qantas-club" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000095E9D20" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); border: 0px;">Qantas Business Rewards Account</a>.</font></li></ul><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br data_liveedit_tagid="00000000095EA310">Kind regards,<br data_liveedit_tagid="00000000095EA550"><br data_liveedit_tagid="00000000095EA660"><strong data_liveedit_tagid="00000000095EA8A0">{!User.FirstName} {!User.LastName}</strong><br data_liveedit_tagid="00000000095EAB00">{!User.Title}<br data_liveedit_tagid="00000000095EAD40">Qantas Business Rewards</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="00000000095EB1E0"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000095EB440" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="00000000095EB900"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000095EBB60" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="00000000095EC020"><td data_liveedit_tagid="00000000095EC280" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><img border="0" src="https://www.qantas.com/content/dam/qantas/sales-news/salesforce-email-assets/images/why-fly-qantas-24.png" width="600" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000095EC4E0" style="width: 600px; display: block;"></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018E5D010"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018E5D270" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 25px; height: 25px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018E5D730"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018E5D990" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 9px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 12px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">1. Selected featured content may not be available on your flight. Inflight entertainment varies by route and aircraft.<br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018E5DBF0"><br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018E5DD00">2. Meals, beverages, entertainment offerings vary between flight times. Alcohol offered during select flight times on select flights.<br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018E5DF40"><br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018E5E050">3. Qantas Club membership and access is subject to the&nbsp;<a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/frequent-flyer/the-qantas-club/terms-conditions.html" target="_blank" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018E5E290" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); border: 0px;">terms and conditions</a>&nbsp;of the Qantas Club.<br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018E5E620"><br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018E5E730">4. The number of destinations is correct as at 5 February 2024, but is subject to change.<br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018E5E970"><br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018E5EA80">5. You must be a member of the Qantas Frequent Flyer program to earn and redeem Qantas Points. A joining fee may apply. Membership and Qantas Points are subject to the Qantas Frequent Flyer program terms and conditions.</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018E5EF20"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018E5F180" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018E5F640"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018E5F8A0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018E60EF0"><td data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018E61150" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018E613B0" style="width: 680px;"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018E61610"><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018E61870"><td align="center" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018E61AD0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="680" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018E61D30" style="font-size: 10px; background-color: rgb(244, 245, 246);"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018E61F90"><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018E621F0"><td data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018E62450" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018E62910"><td align="center" valign="top" width="600" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018E62B70" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; margin-left: 40px; margin-right: 40px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" width="600" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018E62DD0" style="margin-left: 40px; margin-right: 40px;"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018E63030"><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018E63290"><td align="left" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018E634F0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><a href="https://www.facebook.com/Qantas/" target="_blank" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018E63750" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-decoration-line: none; border: 0px;"><img border="0" height="22" src="https://www.qantas.com/content/dam/qantas/sales-news/salesforce-email-assets/facebook.png" title="Facebook" width="40" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018E63880"></a><a href="https://twitter.com/Qantas" target="_blank" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018E63990" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-decoration-line: none; border: 0px;"><img border="0" height="22" src="https://www.qantas.com/content/dam/qantas/sales-news/salesforce-email-assets/twitter.png" title="Twitter" width="43" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018E63AC0"></a><a href="https://www.instagram.com/qantas/" target="_blank" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018E63BD0" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-decoration-line: none; border: 0px;"><img border="0" height="22" src="https://www.qantas.com/content/dam/qantas/sales-news/salesforce-email-assets/instagram.png" title="Instagram" width="51" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018E63D00"></a><a href="https://www.youtube.com/user/Qantas" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-decoration-line: none; border: 0px;"><img border="0" height="22" src="https://www.qantas.com/content/dam/qantas/sales-news/salesforce-email-assets/youtube.png" title="Youtube" width="49" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018E63F40"></a></font></td><td align="right" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018E643D0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; text-align: right; width: 214px;"><a href="https://www.qantas.com/" target="_blank" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018E64630" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-decoration-line: none; border: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><img border="0" height="33" src="https://www.qantas.com/content/dam/qantas/sales-news/salesforce-email-assets/QF-oneworld-logo-lockup.png" title="Qantas" width="166" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018E64760"></font></a></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018E64C00"><td align="center" colspan="2" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018E64E60" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><hr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018E650C0" style="height: 2px; border-width: 0px; color: rgb(218, 218, 218); background-color: rgb(218, 218, 218);"></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018E66710"><td data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018E66970" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018E66BD0" style="width: 680px; background-color: rgb(244, 245, 246);"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018E66E30"><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018E67090"><td align="center" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018E672F0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="600" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018E67550" style="font-size: 10px; margin-left: 40px; margin-right: 40px;"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018E677B0"><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018E67A10"><td border="0" hspace="0" vspace="0" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018E67C70" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; color: rgb(123, 123, 123); line-height: 13px; font-family: Ciutadella, Arial !important;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018E67ED0"><a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/business-rewards/home.html" target="_blank" title="Qantas Business Rewards" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018E68110" style="color: rgb(123, 123, 123); border: 0px;">Qantas Business Rewards</a>&nbsp;|&nbsp;<a href="https://www.qantasbusinessrewards.com/contactus" target="_blank" title="Contact Us" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018E684A0" style="color: rgb(123, 123, 123); border: 0px;">Contact Us</a>&nbsp;|&nbsp;<a href="https://www.qantasbusinessrewards.com/terms" target="_blank" title="Program Terms" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018E68830" style="color: rgb(123, 123, 123); border: 0px;">Program Terms</a>&nbsp;|&nbsp;<a href="http://www.qantas.com/travel/airlines/privacy/global/en" target="_blank" title="Privacy Statement" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018E68BC0" style="color: rgb(123, 123, 123); border: 0px;">Privacy Statement</a>&nbsp;|&nbsp;<a href="http://www.qantas.com/travel/airlines/help/global/en" title="Online Help" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018E68F50" style="color: rgb(123, 123, 123); border: 0px;">Online Help</a></font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018E69540"><td data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018E697A0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018E69C60"><td border="0" hspace="0" vspace="0" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018E69EC0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; color: rgb(123, 123, 123); line-height: 13px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">To unsubscribe from Qantas marketing offers, contact your Account Manager&nbsp;<a href="mailto:?subject=Unsubscribe%20from%20Qantas%20marketing%20offers" target="_blank" title="Unsubscribe" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018E6A120" style="color: rgb(123, 123, 123); border: 0px;">here</a>&nbsp;to unsubscribe.</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018E6A710"><td data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018E6A970" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; margin: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font><hr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018E6AD00" style="height: 2px; border-width: 0px; color: rgb(218, 218, 218); background-color: rgb(218, 218, 218);"></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018E6BFC0"><td data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018E6C220" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018E6C480" style="width: 680px; background-color: rgb(244, 245, 246);"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018E6C6E0"><td align="center" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018E6C940" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="600" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018E6CBA0" style="font-size: 10px; margin-left: 40px; margin-right: 40px;"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018E6CE00"><td data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BFAA150" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 14px; height: 14px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BFAA4E0"><td data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BFAA740" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(123, 123, 123); line-height: 14px; height: 14px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Important information</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BFAAC00"><td class="height_five" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BFAAE60" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 5px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 5px; height: 5px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BFAB910"><td data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BFABB70" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BFABDD0" style="width: 680px; background-color: rgb(244, 245, 246); margin: 0px; padding: 0px;"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BFAC030"><td align="center" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BFAC290" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="600" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BFAC4F0" style="margin: 0px 40px; padding: 0px;"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BFAC750"><td class="t_c" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BFAC9B0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(123, 123, 123); line-height: 13px; height: 13px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">* A business must be a Qantas Business Rewards Member to earn Qantas Points for the business. A one-off joining fee of $89.50 usually applies, is inclusive of any applicable GST and may be varied by Qantas from time to time, without notice, in its absolute discretion. Membership and Qantas Points for business are offered under the&nbsp;<a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/business-rewards/terms-and-conditions.html" target="_blank" title="Qantas Business Rewards Terms and Conditions" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BFACC10" style="color: rgb(123, 123, 123); border: 0px;">Qantas Business Rewards Terms and Conditions</a>&nbsp;and earning thresholds apply. Qantas Points for business are offered under the Qantas Hotels Terms and Conditions. Qantas Business Rewards Members will earn 3 Qantas Point per $1 spent for their business on eligible Qantas Hotels booked online through their Business Account only, or earn 1 Qantas Point per $1 spent for their business on all other eligible domestic and international Qantas Hotels accommodation only (room rate) and paid for in the booking excluding Airbnb bookings. Members will not be able to earn points on additional charges paid to the accommodation provider for extras (including cots, breakfasts and other incidentals) on check-in or check-out (as applicable). Qantas Points will be credited to the Members' Business Rewards Account within 9 weeks after check-out, the additional points earned from booking via the Business Account will be awarded separately up to 11 weeks after check-out. The traveller must be a Qantas Frequent Flyer member to earn points as a Frequent Flyer.</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BFAD200"><td class="t_c" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BFAD460" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(123, 123, 123); line-height: 13px; height: 13px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BFAD920"><td class="t_c" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BFADB80" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(123, 123, 123); line-height: 13px; height: 13px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"># You must be a Qantas Frequent Flyer member to earn Qantas Points. A joining fee may apply. Membership and Qantas Points are subject to the&nbsp;<a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/frequent-flyer/discover-and-join/terms-and-conditions.html" target="_blank" title="Qantas Frequent Flyer program Terms and Conditions" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BFADDE0" style="color: rgb(123, 123, 123); border: 0px;">Qantas Frequent Flyer program Terms and Conditions</a>. Qantas Points and Status Credits (where applicable) are earned on&nbsp;<a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/frequent-flyer/discover-and-join/terms-and-conditions.html#eligibleflights" target="_blank" title="Eligile Flights" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BFAE170" style="color: rgb(123, 123, 123); border: 0px;">eligible flights</a>&nbsp;with a Qantas or applicable&nbsp;<strong data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BFAE500">one</strong>world® Alliance Airline or Airline Partner flight number on your ticket. Qantas Points and Status Credits may not be earned on some fare types and booking classes. See&nbsp;<a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/frequent-flyer/discover-and-join/terms-and-conditions.html#eligibleflights" target="_blank" title="Terms and Conditions" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BFAE890" style="color: rgb(123, 123, 123); border: 0px;">terms and conditions</a>&nbsp;and the&nbsp;<a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/business-rewards/airline-earn-table.html" target="_blank" title="Airline Earning Tables" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BFAEC20" style="color: rgb(123, 123, 123); border: 0px;">Airline Earning Tables</a>&nbsp;for details on the conditions for the applicable airline.</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BFAF210"><td class="t_c" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BFAF470" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(123, 123, 123); line-height: 13px; height: 13px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BFAF930"><td class="t_c" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BFAFB90" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(123, 123, 123); line-height: 13px; height: 13px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">~ Savings are available exclusively to Qantas Business Rewards Members on the base fare of selected fares only and do not apply to taxes, fees and carrier charges. Availability is limited. Member Deals are subject to the Qantas Business Rewards Terms and Conditions.<br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BFAFDF0"><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BFAFF00">§ Only one nomination for the Qantas Business Rewards Gold Accelerator offer can be made per year by an eligible Qantas Business Rewards Level 3 Member. The Qantas Business Rewards account holder or full access user must complete a nomination form through the Qantas Business Rewards Account. The nominee must hold Bronze or Silver Qantas Frequent Flyer membership, be a stored traveller within the Qantas Business Rewards Account and have not been nominated for Gold Accelerator previously within the last 6 months. Once approved, the nominee’s Qantas Frequent Flyer status will be upgraded to Gold, when they earn at least 100 <a href="https://www.qantas.com/fflyer/dyn/flying/status-credits" target="_blank" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BFB0140" style="color: rgb(123, 123, 123); border: 0px;">Status Credits</a>&nbsp;on new bookings for departures between the date the offer is accepted and within 90 days. Status Credit earn must be on eligible flights booked and ticketed on a Qantas flight number (QF) where Status Credits are usually earned. Bonus Status Credit earn and Status Credits earned not via way of an eligible flight will not contribute towards required accelerator total to redeem this offer. Status Credits will be awarded within 6 weeks from departure. Members who have already been activated on previous Qantas Status Fast Track offers in the last 6 months, are not eligible for the Qantas Business Rewards Gold Accelerator offer. Gold Accelerator is only available to members with an Australian or New Zealand residential address on their Qantas Frequent Flyer account. Qantas may revoke or vary this offer in its own discretion.</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BFB0730"><td data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BFB0990" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BFB0E50"><td data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BFB10B0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>